{
  "slug": "numeric-mcp-toolkit",
  "name": "Numeric Mcp Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for the Numeric's MCP.  Purpose-built workflows for accounting teams — rec workbooks, department anomaly scanning, cross-workspace close dashboards, audit evidence exports, close pulse reporting,  consolidated flux commentary, financial metrics, clean report exports, and executive/board-ready reports.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **20 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (20): `accounting-skill-builder` (Builds a new Cowork skill for an accountant who wants to automate a workflow), `ar-ap-aging` (Build an AR (Accounts Receivable) or AP (Accounts Payable) aging from a Numeric workspace), `audit-evidence-export` (Extract a complete activity history from a Numeric workspace for a selected close period and produce a formatted…), `automatically-draft-flux-explanations` (Drafts flux explanations for all GL accounts assigned to the current user in Numeric where a flux explanation…), `checklist-to-numeric` (Convert any close-checklist spreadsheet (FloQast, BlackLine, Trintech, Workiva, or a custom xlsx/csv) into a Numeric-ready import workbook), `clean-report-export` (Generate a clean, analysis-ready financial statement export from Numeric with zero manual cleanup), `close-checklist-diagnostic` (Diagnose a Numeric close checklist, suggest improvements, and coach the controller through optimizing their month-end close process), `close-pulse` (Manager dashboard for close status across checklist, recon, and flux modules), and 12 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install numeric-mcp-toolkit@claude-community` from `geoff-lew/numeric-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Geoff"
  },
